      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i messed up my arm on some scrap metal a few days ago and i think it's getting a bit irritated. there's this thin red line coming out of the cut and going up my arm, and i've been feeling a bit shivery too. probably just a little infection right? do you think i can just double up on some topical antibiotic cream and maybe some extra ibuprofen to sweat it out? i'd rather just handle it here if i can.",
